# MA Crossover Signal Skill

When the user asks about 金叉 / 死叉 / 均线 / 趋势 on a single symbol (or "is X in an uptrend"), use the local skill package.

Preferred local project path:

```text
.cursor/skills/ma-crossover-signal
```

Workflow:

1. Read `.cursor/skills/ma-crossover-signal/SKILL.md` and follow its spec exactly.
2. Run `scripts/ma_crossover_signal.py` with the requested ticker and fast/slow periods; never fabricate prices — the script pulls closes from `panda_data` / `tqx_data`.
3. Load files under `references/` only when the case needs those details.
4. Verify the reported `last_cross` and `state` against the returned series before presenting them.
5. Reproduce the disclaimer from `README.md` (Disclaimer / 免责声明) verbatim; never promise returns and never call a crossover a buy/sell recommendation.
